Subject: [PATCH 1/2] kosmickrisp: rasterize line and point polygon modes

Use Metal triangle wireframe for lines. For polygon points, keep the
assembled triangle through clipping and face selection so point fragments
receive the original polygon's flat attributes and rasterization state.

Base: Mesa 26.3.1 (fec8830e9c94b1d67f3d8469467d5529fb2978cd)

